    "## Load inputs\n",
    "This section loads the single-shot image (from HDF5 and/or SPE), the wavelength axis, the calibration lamp/fiber map, and (optionally) Te/ne profiles for chord-dependent $S/XB$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7a0bc491",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "HDF5 image: (1024, 1024) float64 gate_width_ns= 50.0\n",
      "Successfully loaded 1 file(s) in a SpeFile object\n",
      "SPE image: (1024, 1024) float32 gate_width_ns= 50.0\n",
      "Wavelength axis: (1024,) [226.649, 232.733] nm\n"
     ]
    },
    {
