   "source": [
    "## Fiber map + calibration (Method B Step 1)\n",
    "We build a per-fiber irradiance-per-count curve vs wavelength by stacking calibration lamp SPE images, detecting fibers, and applying the lamp CSV calibration."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "09f4b265",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Found 29 calibration SPEs\n",
