   "source": [
    "## Step 4 (both): photon flux + $S/XB(r)$ + erosion flux\n",
    "We compute photon flux from irradiance using $E_\\gamma = hc/\\lambda_0$ and then apply $\\Gamma = 4\\pi\\,(S/XB)\\,\\Phi_\\gamma$.\n",
    "If DHI profiles are unavailable, this falls back to a constant $S/XB$."
   ]
  },
